        "https://developers.ashbyhq.com/docs/introduction"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to POST /apiKey.info with empty JSON body, matching the pinned validator.",
        "Native Basic auth uses http.auth.basic with the API key as username and an empty password, matching official Authorization: Basic base64(api_key + ':') and pinned Buffer.from(`${apiKey}:`).",
        "HTTP 200 bodies with errorInfo are demoted via bodyErrorPaths [errorInfo]. success is not used because true is treated as an error by native bodyErrorPaths.",
        "Native category is ats-recruitment (source Productivity/Data are not both in Rust CATEGORIES; Ashby is an ATS).",
        "The upstream user-agent is not sent. candidate.search anyOf email/name is omitted because native strict-generated schema rejects anyOf."
      ]
    },
